WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:13.030
my name is peril wolf and I am the lead
singer songwriter for the band peril and

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:17.920
we are an all-girl Hasidic rock band in
Crown Heights Brooklyn all of our live

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:30.050
concerts are for women only
I grew up in a Hasidic home so having a

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:37.190
separation of the sexes in certain
places is pretty common there's a law in

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:43.729
Judaism for men not to listen to the
singing voice of a woman who is not an

00:00:43.729 --> 00:00:46.870
immediate family member

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:54.030
I would say one of the biggest
misconceptions that people have about

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.949
the Hasidic community people think that
women are totally oppressed that women

00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:03.570
can't be leaders I felt very much
empowered as a woman spending time with

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.759
other powerful women and having time to
connect and having our own space women

00:01:08.759 --> 00:01:14.610
deserve a space to rock out the response
from the solicita community has been

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:19.200
really positive mostly you know let's
let's empower women let's make something

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:25.080
new for women when fans come over and
tell you I felt so comfortable tonight I

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:29.039
felt like I could dance I feel like I
could be myself or I really felt the

00:01:29.039 --> 00:01:33.420
powerful energy being around other women
I'm like okay we're doing something

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:37.369
important and that's really all that
matters

